  m_text: 'Hello!

    In this game you need to be attentive and watch the rotation
    of your figure and go through figures with holes, all you need to do is click
    on the right half of the display to turn the figure to the right, similarly,
    to turn to the left you need to click on the left half of the display, everything
    is simple

    Good luck! and be vigilant'
